WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.947 --> 00:00:11.747
Scan the organization JetBrains: the totals and its repositories, the Scan button enabled again

2
00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:13.057
Its clusters start by themselves: “Clustering 7 skills with haiku…”, no button to press

3
00:00:13.057 --> 00:00:15.850
7 skills in 3 clusters, from that one scan: the page asked the server once, the organization not scanned again

4
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:29.113
Scan it again, claude not logged in: the clear message under the totals, and Cluster skills to try again

5
00:00:29.113 --> 00:00:31.374
Cluster skills: the organization scanned again, “Listing JetBrains’s repositories…”, the button disabled

6
00:00:31.374 --> 00:00:34.969
Its progress, as the organization’s own scan shows it: “Scanned 3 of 5 repositories” and the bar

7
00:00:34.969 --> 00:00:38.053
Then haiku: “Clustering 7 skills with haiku…”

8
00:00:38.053 --> 00:00:40.179
The clusters come: the Cluster skills button hidden again

9
00:00:40.179 --> 00:00:48.610
Scan it again, then Skill Atlas while haiku clusters: home, the answer dropped
